The **Extreme Networks WS-AP3825i** (internal antennas) and **WS-AP3825E** (same but with external/detachable antennas) is a dual-band 3x3 MIMO 802.11ac (5GHz) and 802.11b/g/n (2.4GHz) "enterprise grade" access point with two Gigabit Ethernet ports, powered via 802.3af PoE (ETH1, ETH0) or a standard 12V 1.1A power adapter. It was produced by // Extreme Networks//.


